{"id":"41d9670193aa08f6","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-predicate-varieties.md","title":"真理公理域、理论分类与模型部分性的不同维度","display":"df-truth-predicate-varieties — 真理公理域、理论分类与模型部分性的不同维度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-predicate-varieties","aliases":["91-df-truth-predicate-varieties","91-df-T-varieties","91-df-truth-types"],"display":"df-truth-predicate-varieties — 真理公理域、理论分类与模型部分性的不同维度","depends_on":["[[91-df-untyped-truth]]","[[91-df-typed-truth]]","[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-predicate-varieties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-predicate-varieties</span><span>91-df-T-varieties</span><span>91-df-truth-types</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-predicate-varieties — 真理公理域、理论分类与模型部分性的不同维度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"52e708105e8ce779\" href=\"?note=52e708105e8ce779\" title=\"91-df-untyped-truth\">91-df-untyped-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"00a1e20ba65f1f5a\" href=\"?note=00a1e20ba65f1f5a\" title=\"91-df-typed-truth\">91-df-typed-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8f93c57db760a2b7\" href=\"?note=8f93c57db760a2b7\" title=\"91-df-hierarchical-truth\">91-df-hierarchical-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为单 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 真理理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathrm{sch}}\">\\(D_{\\mathrm{sch}}\\)</span> 为其指定双条件模式的标准句子实例域；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为一致固定点。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TypedTh},\\operatorname{TypeFreeTh},\\operatorname{SelfApplicable}\">\\(\\operatorname{TypedTh},\\operatorname{TypeFreeTh},\\operatorname{SelfApplicable}\\)</span> 使用已校准定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchemaTyped},\\mathrm{Partial}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchemaTyped},\\mathrm{Partial}\\)</span> 是下述属性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}varieties}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{SchemaTyped}(D_{\\mathrm{sch}},\\mathcal L_0)\\coloneqq D_{\\mathrm{sch}}=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Partial}(X)\\coloneqq\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\;v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}varieties}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{SchemaTyped}(D_{\\mathrm{sch}},\\mathcal L_0)\\coloneqq D_{\\mathrm{sch}}=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Partial}(X)\\coloneqq\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\;v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>模式实例域、Halbach 的有类型理论判据、自应用句法、多个谓词的层级、指定模型的三值部分性是不同属性，不能把其中一项当作其他项的定义。这里复用理论分类，不再将旧 TypeFree 句法标志冒称原书 type-free。\nTB/UTB/CT 是原书有类型系统，却都允许写自应用原子；KF/FS/VF 的公理约束含真理句。KF 的部分固定点与它的经典闭包有不同满足关系；“模型部分”不能由闭包中的经典 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T\">\\(\\neg T\\)</span> 单独识别。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 10.1；§15.1、第 18 章、§20.2。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-untyped-truth","status":"resolved","id":"52e708105e8ce779","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-untyped-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-typed-truth","status":"resolved","id":"00a1e20ba65f1f5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-typed-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-hierarchical-truth","status":"resolved","id":"8f93c57db760a2b7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\mathrm{sch}}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TypedTh},\\operatorname{TypeFreeTh},\\operatorname{SelfApplicable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchemaTyped},\\mathrm{Partial}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}varieties}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{SchemaTyped}(D_{\\mathrm{sch}},\\mathcal L_0)\\coloneqq D_{\\mathrm{sch}}=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Partial}(X)\\coloneqq\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\;v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg T","display":false}],"bytes":1792,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate-varieties]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[